{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RCA (Phase 1 exit) — root cause PROVEN at runtime.\n\nMECHANISM: 9 sites derived the repo/config root as os.path.dirname(tracker). That equals the repo root ONLY for a co-located store. REBAR_TRACKER_DIR relocation is a SUPPORTED feature (deployed MCP server: store /var/gerrit/site/mcp-tickets, code /app), where the tracker's parent has no rebar.toml, so every config read there resolves an EMPTY config.\n\nMOST SEVERE CONSEQUENCE (AC#1): transition_compute set repo_root_str = os.path.dirname(tracker) and fed it to gates.plan_review_precheck as the CONFIG root. On a relocated store the plan-review start-work-gate flag read from an empty config == OFF, so the 'transition open->in_progress' enforcement boundary SILENTLY STOPPED APPLYING.\n\nDISCRIMINATING EVIDENCE: reproduced OUTSIDE any tree containing a rebar.toml (an in-tree tmpdir masks the bug because _discover_project_config walks UP and finds the worktree's own rebar.toml). On a relocated store: 'claim' BLOCKS (already fixed by chuffy-arbored-goldfish) while 'transition open->in_progress' DID NOT block — the exact split predicted by the two code paths.\n\nATTRIBUTION: the AC#1 transition-gate escape was introduced by stab-bunch-foyer (65e3-1fc6-5f3b-4c67, commit 95577d196015, PR #49), which consolidated the shared start-work gate but wired the transition site's cfg_root to repo_root_str (= dirname(tracker)) while the claim side correctly used repo_root. chuffy-arbored-goldfish later fixed the claim path + gates.py signatures and explicitly deferred 'the rest' (these 9 sites) to THIS ticket, establishing the construct as a defect and REBAR_TRACKER_DIR relocation as a design invariant.\n\nLEGITIMACY: defect (behavior-preserving fix; co-located dirname(tracker) == git-toplevel == repo root). Standing intent unambiguous (prior Fixed: ticket chuffy-arbored-goldfish). Escalation rules checked -> PROCEED to fix; one design-laden site (run_sweep detached child) DEFERRED to a follow-up."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787939336936045001,"uuid":"3ba8d813-d71f-48d9-aad9-a1d3797094a8"}